## Tech Stack — NEVER deviate from this

- **HTML5 Canvas + vanilla JavaScript only.** No frameworks (no React, no Vue, no Phaser).
- **No npm packages.** No build tools. No bundlers.
- Everything runs by opening index.html in a browser via Live Server.
- The goal is a browser game that can later be wrapped in Electron for desktop — zero rewrites.

